661
00:36:13,876 --> 00:36:15,345
What are you talking about ?

662
00:36:15,477 --> 00:36:17,947
[ Dewey ] Some idiot in a Ghostface mask .

663
00:36:18,081 --> 00:36:20,749
Three attacks so far . One dead .

664
00:36:20,883 --> 00:36:23,785
Something about this one just feels different .

665
00:36:25,687 --> 00:36:27,156
Are you okay ?

666
00:36:27,890 --> 00:36:29,459
[ Dewey ] I 'm fine , you know me .

667
00:36:29,591 --> 00:36:31,361
Yeah .

668
00:36:31,493 --> 00:36:33,029
I do . That 's why I 'm asking .

669
00:36:33,628 --> 00:36:35,298
I 'm fine .

670
00:36:35,431 --> 00:36:36,698
I just ...

671
00:36:36,833 --> 00:36:38,901
want you to be safe up there . Do you have a gun ?

672
00:36:39,035 --> 00:36:42,472
I 'm Sidney fucking Prescott . Of course I have a gun .

673
00:36:42,604 --> 00:36:43,840
[ chuckles ]

674
00:36:44,706 --> 00:36:46,075
Good . That 's good .

675
00:36:46,209 --> 00:36:48,144
[ sighs ] Does Gale know ?

676
00:36:48,277 --> 00:36:50,079
No , she 's my next call .

677
00:36:50,645 --> 00:36:51,981
But , Sid , promise me :

678
00:36:52,115 --> 00:36:55,151
No matter what you hear or what you see on the news ,

679
00:36:55,284 --> 00:36:56,486
don 't come here .

680
00:36:56,618 --> 00:36:57,854
No offense , Dewey . I have no intention

681
00:36:57,987 --> 00:36:59,889
of ever setting foot in that town again .

682
00:37:00,423 --> 00:37:01,656
Good .

683
00:37:02,691 --> 00:37:04,460
Dewey ...

684
00:37:04,593 --> 00:37:07,830
whoever this killer 's after , I 'm glad they have you to protect them .

685
00:37:09,165 --> 00:37:10,565
But ...

686
00:37:11,501 --> 00:37:13,136
you be safe , okay ?

687
00:37:14,203 --> 00:37:15,670
Will do .

688
00:37:15,805 --> 00:37:17,807
[ Sidney ] It 's good to hear your voice .

689
00:37:18,441 --> 00:37:19,674
You too , Sid .

690
00:37:22,544 --> 00:37:25,448
Come on . Get it together , Dewey .

691
00:37:25,580 --> 00:37:27,917
[ breathes deeply ]

692
00:37:39,728 --> 00:37:41,130
[ grunts ]

693
00:37:45,435 --> 00:37:46,469
[ groans ]

694
00:37:47,403 --> 00:37:50,306
Probably shouldn 't have sent the smiley face .

695
00:38:18,101 --> 00:38:19,368
[ sighs ]

696
00:38:25,875 --> 00:38:27,944
[ car approaching ]

697
00:38:28,077 --> 00:38:28,911
[ car stops ]

698
00:38:29,045 --> 00:38:31,280
[ car door opens , slams ]

699
00:38:32,815 --> 00:38:34,383
Holy shit . He came .

700
00:38:37,487 --> 00:38:41,290
I 've decided to temporarily assist you in your investigation .

701
00:38:41,424 --> 00:38:42,892
Thank you .

702
00:38:45,161 --> 00:38:46,661
Look , just because that guy showered

703
00:38:46,795 --> 00:38:48,730
doesn 't mean he should have a gun .

704
00:38:49,499 --> 00:38:51,633
- [ Sam ] Yeah . - [ Richie ] Yeah .

705
00:38:52,835 --> 00:38:54,337
[ chattering ]

706
00:38:54,470 --> 00:38:57,507
[ Richie ] How do you know so much about the Stab movies ?

707
00:38:57,639 --> 00:38:59,242
[ Dewey ] Runs in her family .

708
00:38:59,842 --> 00:39:01,077
Randy was our uncle .

709
00:39:01,210 --> 00:39:03,045
RIP . [ kisses ]

710
00:39:04,347 --> 00:39:06,748
[ Mindy ] You said to bring everybody .

711
00:39:07,183 --> 00:39:08,217
[ Sam ] Hey .

712
00:39:09,552 --> 00:39:12,188
Ooh , suspects !

713
00:39:13,122 --> 00:39:15,358
My brother would be so proud .

714
00:39:15,825 --> 00:39:17,059
Hey , Martha .

715
00:39:18,161 --> 00:39:20,396
Dewey ! Hi !

716
00:39:20,530 --> 00:39:22,031
You look ...

717
00:39:24,133 --> 00:39:25,168
Yeah .

718
00:39:25,767 --> 00:39:26,735
How 's the wife ?

719
00:39:26,869 --> 00:39:28,538
Mom , we 're good . Thank you .

720
00:39:28,670 --> 00:39:31,807
All right , kids , have fun .

721
00:39:34,377 --> 00:39:37,079
I asked Mindy to call everybody here , because ...

722
00:39:39,248 --> 00:39:41,317
there 's something I have to tell you .

723
00:39:42,652 --> 00:39:44,187
[ Chad ] Let me get this straight .

724
00:39:44,320 --> 00:39:46,556
You 're saying that you 're the daughter of Billy Loomis ,

725
00:39:46,721 --> 00:39:48,790
and , what , that one of us is the killer ?

726
00:39:48,925 --> 00:39:51,561
The killer told me he knew my secret .

727
00:39:52,328 --> 00:39:54,096
He attacked Tara to lure me back here .

728
00:39:54,230 --> 00:39:56,599
[ Chad ] But then why immediately go and murder

729
00:39:56,731 --> 00:39:58,767
some douche-nozzle that was stalking Liv ?

730
00:39:58,901 --> 00:40:00,403
[ Wes ] And why does it have to be one of us ?

731
00:40:00,536 --> 00:40:03,839
What about Deputy Dewey here ? Maybe he 's the killer .

732
00:40:04,307 --> 00:40:05,208
No offense .

733
00:40:05,341 --> 00:40:07,543
None taken , but what 's my motive ?

734
00:40:07,677 --> 00:40:09,478
You got stabbed a billion times ,

735
00:40:09,612 --> 00:40:12,548
got dumped by your famous wife and crawled into a bottle .

736
00:40:12,682 --> 00:40:14,884
I think it 's safe to say you 're on the suspect list .

737
00:40:15,017 --> 00:40:17,019
Well , maybe you 're the killer .

738
00:40:17,954 --> 00:40:19,355
Because that cut deep .

739
00:40:19,488 --> 00:40:22,258
[ Amber ] That douche-nozzle is connected .

740
00:40:22,391 --> 00:40:25,161
I googled him . His mom is Leslie Macher .

741
00:40:25,995 --> 00:40:28,064
- Stu Macher 's sister . - Who 's Stu Macher ?

742
00:40:28,197 --> 00:40:30,466
He 's Billy Loomis 's accomplice .

743
00:40:30,600 --> 00:40:32,268
A real loony tune .

744
00:40:32,401 --> 00:40:34,036
Okay . Okay .

745
00:40:34,170 --> 00:40:38,641
So the first three attacks are all on people related to the original killers .

746
00:40:38,773 --> 00:40:41,344
Oh , my God . He 's making a requel !

747
00:40:41,477 --> 00:40:42,345
A what ?

748
00:40:42,478 --> 00:40:43,512
Or a legacyquel .

749
00:40:43,646 --> 00:40:44,680
Fans are torn on the terminology .

750
00:40:44,814 --> 00:40:45,815
Please speak English .

751
00:40:45,948 --> 00:40:47,016
Remember the Stab movie

752
00:40:47,149 --> 00:40:48,284
that came out last year ?

753
00:40:48,417 --> 00:40:49,418
Oh , yeah !

754
00:40:49,552 --> 00:40:50,920
The one the Knives Out guy directed ?

755
00:40:51,053 --> 00:40:52,655
I actually really liked that one .

756
00:40:52,787 --> 00:40:54,423
Of course you did . You have terrible taste .

757
00:40:54,557 --> 00:40:55,858
I hate you .

758
00:40:55,992 --> 00:40:58,661
The point is , the hard-core Stab fans hated it .

759
00:40:58,793 --> 00:41:00,029
You go on 4chan and Dreadit ,

760
00:41:00,162 --> 00:41:01,664
all they 're talking about is how Stab 8

761
00:41:01,796 --> 00:41:03,199
pissed on their childhoods .

762
00:41:03,332 --> 00:41:05,334
How they crammed in social commentary just to elevate it .

763
00:41:05,468 --> 00:41:07,136
How the main character 's a Mary Sue .

764
00:41:07,270 --> 00:41:08,804
- What 's a Mary Sue ? - You really don 't want to know .

765
00:41:08,938 --> 00:41:10,940
What 's wrong with elevated horror ?

766
00:41:11,073 --> 00:41:12,975
I mean , Jordan Peele fucking rules .

767
00:41:13,109 --> 00:41:15,278
Uh , obviously , but that 's not Stab .

768
00:41:15,411 --> 00:41:20,082
Real Stab movies are meta slasher whodunits , full stop .

769
00:41:20,216 --> 00:41:22,551
- Come on . It 's just a movie . - No , it 's not .

770
00:41:22,685 --> 00:41:25,955
To some people , the original is their favorite thing in the world .

771
00:41:26,088 --> 00:41:28,424
The movie that made them love horror .

772
00:41:28,557 --> 00:41:31,761
That Mom or Dad showed them when they were ten that bonded them together .

773
00:41:31,894 --> 00:41:35,364
And God help anyone who slightly fucks with that special memory .

774
00:41:35,498 --> 00:41:37,533
Who makes a movie they think disrespects it .

775
00:41:37,667 --> 00:41:41,937
It sounds like our killer is writing his own version of Stab 8 ,

776
00:41:42,071 --> 00:41:44,573
but doing it as a requel .

777
00:41:44,707 --> 00:41:45,741
Which is ?

778
00:41:46,842 --> 00:41:49,545
See , you can 't just reboot a franchise from scratch anymore .

779
00:41:49,679 --> 00:41:50,980
The fans won 't stand for it .

780
00:41:51,113 --> 00:41:53,616
Black Christmas , Child 's Play , Flatliners ...

781
00:41:53,749 --> 00:41:55,084
That shit doesn 't work .

